<blockquote class="big-q" style="margin:0; color:#ffffff; max-width:780px">“What an AMAZING experience from start to finish we have had adopting our beautiful kittens. Such a professional and knowledgeable service.”</blockquote>
<div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px">
<p style="margin:0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6"><strong style="font-weight:700; color:#ffffff">Megan Sobotowska</strong><br>Adopted two kittens</p>
<p style="margin:0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; max-width:420px">“Every question I have asked has been answered in depth. Whatever time I message / call it’s always answered.”</p>
