<section class="sec" style="background:#ffffff; padding-top:80px"><div class="wrap"><div class="q-cols"><figure class="q-item" style="margin:0"><blockquote class="q-text" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0">“Throughout this process, we were never rushed or pressured and so now feel confident that we can give these girls a happy long life.”</blockquote><figcaption class="q-name">Lucca Addy</figcaption></figure><figure class="q-item" style="margin:0"><blockquote class="q-text" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0">“After a video assessment of our living space, our adoption was approved and Sophie was ready to come home. She was brought to our house with everything she needed (bed, food etc) and settled in straight away.”</blockquote><figcaption class="q-name">Nichola Davey</figcaption></figure><figure class="q-item" style="margin:0"><blockquote class="q-text" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0">“Katrina Rose was amazing, very pleasant and responsive. Even set up a chat so I can get to know Milo, as I live a bit far.”</blockquote><figcaption class="q-name">Petra Kucerova</figcaption></figure><figure class="q-item" style="margin:0"><blockquote class="q-text" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0">“First time I’ve ever adopted a cat and Happy Paws made it so easy for me! They were extremely helpful and gave me so much advice for looking after my new baby.”</blockquote><figcaption class="q-name">Hannah Bunn</figcaption></figure><figure class="q-item" style="margin:0"><blockquote class="q-text" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0">“Penny was in beautiful condition a very loving cat so could tell she had been well looked after while in foster care and by previous owners.”</blockquote><figcaption class="q-name">Susan Scott</figcaption></figure><figure class="q-item" style="margin:0"><blockquote class="q-text" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0">“An absolutely wonderful team! It’s lovely to see the work they do for the kitties in their area, finding them their forever homes, providing foster care & offering help and advice to those that need it.”</blockquote><figcaption class="q-name">Purrs Cat Rescue<br><span style="font-weight:400; color:#4F596B">Fellow rescue</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="q-item" style="margin:0"><blockquote class="q-text" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0">“Katrina works tirelessly to ensure the best for every cat/ kitten that comes into her care.”</blockquote><figcaption class="q-name">Maggie Gilchrist</figcaption></figure><figure class="q-item" style="margin:0"><blockquote class="q-text" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0">“Katrina has offered support and advice on an elderly cat that had been kicked out and left to fend for itself for 2 years. She took it in, got emergency vet treatment, then found the perfect home for her.”</blockquote><figcaption class="q-name">Janice Peart<br><span style="font-weight:400; color:#4F596B">Pet Angels Wearside</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="q-item" style="margin:0"><blockquote class="q-text" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0">“Got two lovely little kittens. Communication was amazing from the start and Katrina and Vicki were really helpful.”</blockquote><figcaption class="q-name">Corinna Laurie</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

